{%- comment -%}
  Fitting-details band

  Only needed if you are layering the look onto a theme you already
  have: Customize → Add section → Custom Liquid, then paste
  everything below this comment, with shopify/custom-css.css in
  Theme settings → Custom CSS.

  The uploadable theme in theme/ has proper editable sections
  instead — use those if you installed it.

  Generated from src/mockup.html by build.js — edit that, not this.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="bsr-fitting bsr-section">
  <div class="bsr-wrap bsr-fitting__grid">
    <div class="bsr-fitting__copy">
      <span class="bsr-pill bsr-pill--mustard">★ The Fit</span>
      <h2 class="bsr-display">Four numbers.<br>One perfect setup.</h2>
      <p>Junior gear isn't a t-shirt size. Ski length comes from height, binding
         release comes from weight, and both get dialed in for how confidently
         your kid actually skis.</p>
      <p>You tell us at checkout, we pull the right setup before you show up, and a
         technician confirms it in person. No guessing from a dropdown.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bsr-formcard">
      <h4>★ Fitting details — collected at checkout</h4>
      <div class="bsr-duo">
        <div class="bsr-field"><label>Age</label><div class="bsr-inp">8 years</div></div>
        <div class="bsr-field"><label>Height</label><div class="bsr-inp">4′ 3″</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bsr-duo">
        <div class="bsr-field"><label>Weight</label><div class="bsr-inp">62 lbs</div></div>
        <div class="bsr-field"><label>Boot size (if known)</label><div class="bsr-inp">Youth 3</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bsr-field">
        <label>Skier ability</label>
        <div class="bsr-chips">
          <span class="bsr-chip">First time</span>
          <span class="bsr-chip bsr-chip--on">Beginner</span>
          <span class="bsr-chip">Intermediate</span>
          <span class="bsr-chip">Advanced</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="bsr-fnote">Not sure on a number? Ballpark it — we measure and confirm
         everything at the fitting appointment.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
